<title>UK: Rugby says Robin Gourlay to be new chairman.</title>
<headline>Rugby says Robin Gourlay to be new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rugby Group Plc said on Monday that Robin Gourlay would be the new chairman of the group.</p>
<p>Geoffrey Higham, who retires as chairman today, said in a statement that the board of the building materials group had appointed Gourlay, a non-executive director since June 1994, to succeed him.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
